N EBISU STN COIN LOCKER</b> (in at the 11:00â€“15:00 do-c clean-out) â€” <b>collect it tonight</b>: lockers bill by calendar day, and the <b>09:30 bike pickup on 30 Jul depends on having it</b>. Buy-if-light OK: small MUJI detergent Â· light envelopes. Initial D mapo from <b>8/1</b> only. <b>Skip Asakusa today</b> â€” tail + Benizuru 7am shop tickets + Iyoshi.<br>â‘  <b>Breakfast â€” West Georgia St. does not exist.</b> Walked to æµæ¯”å¯¿å—2-3-15 OKA7ãƒ“ãƒ«3F: no such shop. Treat as closed. <b>EBISU FOOD HALL instead âœ“</b> â€” æµæ¯”å¯¿å—1-1-9 ã‚·ãƒãƒ¤ãƒ“ãƒ«1F Â· ~2 min from Ebisu Stn Â· from 9:00. <b>Would repeat</b> â€” food good not remarkable, but strong AC and a chill room, easy solo.<br>â‘¡ <b>Dollar Ranger âœ“ DONE</b> â€” foreign-currency exchange (not packing/sundries; that note was wrong). <b>160.55 JPY/USD Â· Â¥802,750 for $5,000 Â· no commission.</b> Mid-market 161.8, so a 1.25 yen spread = <b>0.77%</b> â€” street counters run 2â€“4% and airports 5â€“8%. Best-rate reputation now <b>verified</b>, not repeated.<br>â‘¢ <b>Isetan âœ“ DONE</b> â€” Diptyque browsed and <b>the mens scent is a yes</b>. <b>LOCKED: 8 bottles, bought 30 Jul</b> on the Shinjuku dinner return with the 50L (~3.5â€“4 kg, too heavy for tonight). <b>Mens wallets confirmed present âœ“</b> â€” <b>closer look 30 Jul</b>, main building + ä¼Šå‹¢ä¸¹ãƒ¡ãƒ³ã‚ºé¤¨. <b>Ask for å°å‚³å±‹ / ç”²å·å°ä¼ by name</b>: Mitsukoshi-Isetan stocks Indenya including <b>Isetan-exclusive patterns</b>. Deerskin with lacquer, a Kofu craft â€” the answer to not wanting an expensive wallet for its own sake. å°å‚³å±‹ ä¸ŠåŸå‹‡ä¸ƒ is the ç·æœ¬å®¶; å°å‚³ã®å±±æœ¬ is a different inden house, so name the maker.<br>â‘£ <b>Kinokuniya â€” ERRAND FAILED âœ—</b> okozukai / ãƒãƒè¢‹ <b>not stocked</b>, walked it. It is a bookstore; stationery is pens and notebooks. <b>Do not route here for envelopes.</b><br>â‘¤ <b>Kagaya âœ“ DONE â€” and the taste test settled it: Seven Stars wins.</b> The Peace 10-pack was bought